PROFILE_NOTES=(
  "Midgard records decisions about spacecraft. It does not command spacecraft and has no link to a mission control system."
  "Check export control (UK Strategic Export Controls, and ITAR or EAR for US-origin data) before loading mission data."
  "Feed telemetry summaries through Heimdall feed sources or Forge jobs. Raw telemetry processing is out of scope."
  "Two administrators are created for dual control. Hand each passkey file to its owner and remove it from this server."
)
